# Build context is the REPO ROOT (see ./Dockerfile), so keep the upload small and
# deterministic — without this, frontend/node_modules and signal-engine/target alone
# add hundreds of MB to every deploy.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/target
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
frontend
docs
_attic
*.md
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/logs
**/data/snapshots
**/.claude
**/.agent
signal-engine/eval
backtest-lab/
